# NASA Earthdata Login token for the data pipelines (OMI NO2, MODIS NDVI and LST, GPM IMERG, GLDAS).
# 1. Create a free account at https://urs.earthdata.nasa.gov/users/new
# 2. Approve "NASA GESDISC DATA ARCHIVE" and "LP DAAC Data Pool" under Applications > Authorized Apps
# 3. Generate a token at https://urs.earthdata.nasa.gov/profile (Generate Token)
# 4. Copy this file to data-pipeline/.env and paste the token there. The .env file is never committed.
#    Do NOT paste the token into this .env.example file: it goes to GitHub with the code.
#    Не вставляйте токен у цей файл (.env.example): він потрапляє на GitHub разом із кодом.
EARTHDATA_TOKEN=
